sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant RD as agora-run-debate
    participant LA as agora-lead-specialist<br/>(Haiku)
    participant SA as Specialists<br/>(roster 3–4, Sonnet)
    participant SR as agora-score-round<br/>(Haiku)
    participant WR as agora-write-report<br/>(Haiku)
    participant FS as File System

    User->>RD: /agora-run-debate [slug]
    RD->>FS: Read ideas/{slug}/README.md
    FS-->>RD: idea + current scores + constraints
    Note over RD: Extract [CONSTRAINTS] if ## Constraints present
    RD->>LA: /agora-lead-specialist [slug] + [CONSTRAINTS]
    LA->>FS: Read idea + readiness scores + constraints
    LA-->>RD: JSON roster ["specialist-skeptic","specialist-tech-lead",...]

    loop For each round (max 2–3, adaptive)
        RD->>RD: Print round header

        loop For each specialist in roster
            RD->>FS: Read specialist MEMORY.md (if exists)
            FS-->>RD: specialist memory (or empty)
            Note over RD,SA: Round 1: full idea description<br/>Round 2+: idea name + previous round synthesis only
            RD->>SA: /specialist-{name} with context + prior messages + memory + [CONSTRAINTS]
            SA-->>RD: specialist analysis (250–400 words, respects constraints)
            RD->>RD: Append to round messages list
        end

        RD->>SR: /agora-score-round (slug, round messages, current scores, [CONSTRAINTS])
        SR-->>RD: updated scores, synthesis, open_questions, best_answers

        RD->>FS: Update ideas/{slug}/README.md (scores + questions)
        RD->>RD: Print milestone update

        alt readiness >= 85%
            RD->>RD: Terminate — reason: target_reached
        else rounds == max
            RD->>RD: Terminate — reason: max_rounds
        end
    end

    RD->>WR: /agora-write-report (session data)
    WR->>FS: Write ideas/{slug}/sessions/{slug}-session-{n}-{date}.md
    WR-->>RD: filename

    RD->>FS: Update Session History in README.md
    RD->>FS: Update ideas_index.md

    loop For each specialist in roster
        RD->>SA: /specialist-{name} MODE:memory-update (contributions + synthesis)
        SA-->>RD: Updated MEMORY.md content
        RD->>FS: Write .claude/skills/{specialist}/MEMORY.md
    end

    RD-->>User: Session complete summary
    Note over RD,User: Post-session options (opt-in):<br/>/agora-review-specialists {slug}<br/>/agora-hire-specialists {slug}
